                            <p><strong>应用场景：</strong></p>
                            <ul>
                                <li>优先队列</li>
                                <li>Top K 问题</li>
                                <li>堆排序</li>
                            </ul>
                            <p><strong>典型题目：</strong>数组中的第K个最大元素、合并K个有序链表</p>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <!-- 图 -->
                <div class="accordion-item">
                    <h2 class="accordion-header">
                        <button class="accordion-button collapsed" type="button" data-bs-toggle="collapse" data-bs-target="#graph">
                            7. 图 (Graph)
                        </button>
                    </h2>
                    <div id="graph" class="accordion-collapse collapse" data-bs-parent="#dataStructuresAccordion">
                        <div class="accordion-body">
                            <p><strong>表示方法：</strong></p>
                            <ul>
                                <li>邻接矩阵</li>
                                <li>邻接表</li>
                            </ul>
                            <p><strong>遍历算法：</strong></p>
                            <ul>
                                <li>深度优先搜索（DFS）</li>
                                <li>广度优先搜索（BFS）</li>
                            </ul>
                            <p><strong>经典算法：</strong></p>
                            <ul>
                                <li>最短路径（Dijkstra、Floyd）</li>
                                <li>最小生成树（Prim、Kruskal）</li>
                                <li>拓扑排序</li>
